📊 Bare Beauty — Instagram Content Performance & Audience Intelligence DashboardProject 
Domain: Social Media Marketing Analytics & Business IntelligenceTech Stack: Google Looker Studio, Microsoft Excel / Google Sheets,
Business Intelligence ModelingRole: Analytics Lead & Content Creator🎯 
Executive Summary & Problem StatementManaging a growing beauty and skincare brand (Bare Beauty) requires balancing creative production with data-driven strategy. Relying solely on surface-level vanity metrics provided by standard Instagram Insights often leads to inefficient content effort and unpredictable reach.This project was built to transform raw post-level interaction data into a Prescriptive Analytics Engine. By modeling content formats, hook tactics, and demographic reach, the goal was to identify high-ROI content structures and systematically improve audience retention and save rates.
🛠️ Data Pipeline & Technical ArchitectureSchema Design & Data Normalization:Ingested and structured post-level performance data across 30+ posts.Defined standardized dimensions: Content ID, Content Type (Reels, Carousels, Static), Hook Strategy (Text-overlay vs. Visual), and timestamp attributes.
Tracks core interaction metrics: Reach, Views, Likes, Saves, Shares, and Engagement %.Metric Engineering:Engineered calculated fields to measure content efficiency beyond view counts:$$\text{Save-to-Reach Ratio} = \frac{\text{Saves}}{\text{Reach}} \times 100$$
Standardized engagement rates to evaluate true audience retention per format.
Interactive BI Dashboard Architecture:
Page 1: Content Efficiency & Hook IntelligenceExecutive Scorecards (Total Reach, Views, Engagement Trends).Format Efficiency Analysis (Reels vs. Carousels performance distribution).Hook Strategy Evaluation (Text-overlay vs. Visual hooks retention).Performance Heatmap Matrix with conditional formatting for rapid outlier detection.
Page 2: Audience Demographics & Spatial DistributionMulti-dimensional audience segmentation across Gender Split, Age Brackets, Top Cities, and Country Distribution.
💡 Key Business Insights & Prescriptive Recommendations
🪝 Hook Strategy Optimization:Reels incorporating Text-on-Screen Hooks achieved a 2.4x higher Save-to-Reach ratio compared to purely visual intros.Action: Mandate 3-second structured text-overlay hooks for all future educational skincare reviews.
📦 Format Allocation & Funnel Strategy:While Reels drive top-of-funnel discovery and account for 75%+ of new reach, Carousel posts generate over 70% of total saves.Action: Deploy Reels for brand reach and follow up with Carousels for community retention and product breakdowns.
📍 Demographic & Geographic Alignment:Audience concentration is heavily indexed toward Tier-1 metro cities among the 18–24 and 25–34 female age brackets.Action: Align product showcase choices and messaging with urban skincare trends relevant to this demographic segment.
